==","user":{"login":"kqyang","id":7329892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjk4OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7329892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang","html_url":"https://github.com/kqyang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-10-17T22:12:17Z","updated_at":"2019-10-17T22:12:17Z","body":"@ojw28 I believe there is another bug in ExoPlayer. \r\n\r\nThe resolution in HLS master playlist is the \"display\" resolution. See https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc8216#section-4.3.4.2.1:\r\n\r\n>    If an EXT-X-STREAM-INF tag contains a RESOLUTION attribute and a\r\n      VIDEO attribute, then every alternative video Rendition MUST have\r\n      an optimal display resolution matching the value of the RESOLUTION\r\n      attribute.\r\n\r\nThe display resolution is not the same as frame resolution (a.k.a storage resolution or codec resolution) for non square pixels. \r\n\r\nAs shown in https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/6551#issuecomment-542713388, the content has a frame resolution of 1130:480 and a display resolution of 1129:480. \r\n\r\nThe player should use frame resolution instead of display resolution when querying video capabilities as frame resolution is what decoder cares. \r\n - For mp4 files, frame resolution can be extracted from width and height in Sample Description box.\r\n - For TS files, the player has to inspect SPS to extract the frame resolution. \r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/543383218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kqyang","id":7329892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczMjk4OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7329892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang","html_url":"https://github.com/kqyang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kqyang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2722920874,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MjcyMjkyMDg3NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/2722920874","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.git